{"id":"7937ecc11ac59760","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbcoeff.md","title":"Canonical multilinear coefficient map","display":"df-pbcoeff — Canonical multilinear coefficient map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbcoeff","aliases":["27-df-pbcoeff"],"display":"df-pbcoeff — Canonical multilinear coefficient map","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.2","source_statement":"Theorem 13.1 following coefficient formula","source_printed_pages":"571","source_pdf_pages":"595","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbcoeff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbcoeff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbcoeff — Canonical multilinear coefficient map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.1 following coefficient formula"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"571"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq N\\quad\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1):i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0):i\\in N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq N\\quad\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1):i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0):i\\in N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad c_f(S)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|A|}f(\\chi_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad c_f(S)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|A|}f(\\chi_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书的 Möbius transform。每个系数由有限和唯一决定；它不依赖于任意选取的多项式表示。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a> 证明此系数确实重构函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbpoly","status":"resolved","id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书的 Möbius transform。每个系数由有限和唯一决定；它不依赖于任意选取的多项式表示。[[27-thm-pbpoly]] 证明此系数确实重构函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\subseteq N\\quad\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1):i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0):i\\in N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^N.","display":true},{"tex":"c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad c_f(S)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|A|}f(\\chi_A).","display":true}],"bytes":1342,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0acb3965b289fee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$\\chi_A$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。"},{"id":"efe2d4b0294be128","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$c_f,\\chi_A$ 经 [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]] 的上游 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$U_n$ 经该定义的上游。"},{"id":"b4cf3e38d764f1d6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。"},{"id":"476d67d753efdb3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$c_f:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。"},{"id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$c_f$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"723fde838d821737","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$I=\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i<j\\}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 且$\\forall S\\subseteq N\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)$。$c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]；$c_0=c_f(\\varnothing)$，$a_i=c_f(\\{i\\})$，$a_{ij}=c_f(\\{i,j\\})$。"},{"id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-submodular]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$c_q$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），二次系数符号判据（see [[27-thm-quadsubmodchar]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff|df-pbcoeff — Canonical multilinear coefficient map]]"},{"id":"9de98dd40c837b73","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$A\\subseteq N$；$\\mathcal B_{n,1}$ 见 [[27-df-pbl2approx]]，$c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。$M_A,g_A,g_f$ 为下式定义的 $\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 函数；空积为 1。"},{"id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$c_f$ 和 $\\chi_A$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。空积取 1。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd","3153aa2be8b0a164"]}